# VID-01 — Provide a poster image

## Rationale

A `poster` avoids a blank frame and improves perceived performance before the video loads.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check video <file>
```

## How to fix

Propose adding `poster` referencing a representative frame (via `image_url`).
